OL,5,G1955 Heartbeat
OL,6,     FMembers of the local constabulary
OL,7,     Fpatrol the town of Ashfordly and
OL,8,     Fthe nearby village of Aidensfield,
OL,9,     Fkeeping the peace whilst also
OL,10,     Fdealing with local loveable
OL,11,     Frogues.
OL,12,G2100 Vera
OL,13,     FBAFTA and Golden Globe winner
OL,14,     FBrenda Blethyn dons her iconic mac
OL,15,     Fand hat to return as the
OL,16,     Funorthodox but brilliantly
OL,17,     Fperceptive Detective Chief
OL,18,     FInspector Vera Stanhope.
